        "created_at": "2013-11-28T21:16:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Option 2 is correct. For each instance of damage dealt, you can choose to activate Wrest the Mind (redirect the damage, damage the WtM target, damage Visionary). It should be noted that if the second step (damaging the target that WtM is played on) kills the target, Wrest the Mind is also destroyed and deals no damage to Visionary.</p>",
